# Line endings
#
# These are JSON templates and Markdown docs. They contain no binaries and
# nothing that cares about the platform, so the whole repository is pinned to
# LF. Without this file, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# every file to CRLF, which makes "Download ZIP" produce different bytes
# depending on who downloads it — for no reason at all.
#
# text=auto   : let Git decide what is text
# eol=lf      : check text out with LF on every platform, Windows included
* text=auto eol=lf
